msgstr "https://github.com/trstnbde/baukasten"

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A standalone fork of Twenty Twenty-Five 1.5 that carries three design systems as styles: Organic (the default), Modernist and Nocturne, plus Noto Sans and Noto Serif as font presets. Templates, template parts and patterns come from Twenty Twenty-Five; all fonts are bundled, so the theme sends no requests to third parties."
msgstr "Ein eigenständiger Fork von Twenty Twenty-Five 1.5 mit drei Designsystemen als Stile: Organic (Standard), Modernist und Nocturne, dazu Noto Sans und Noto Serif als Schrift-Presets. Templates, Template-Teile und Vorlagen stammen aus Twenty Twenty-Five. Alle Schriften sind enthalten, das Theme sendet also keine Anfragen an Dritte."

#. Author of the theme
